 /* Persistent 4 KiB GMU stage-1 domain, 32-bit IOVA, 48-bit PA.
- * Tables and backing are boot-lifetime reservations. Caller MUST keep CM3
- * reset asserted and the context disabled while building. activate only after
- * publish + TLB invalidation + SID-specific translation checks by the owner.
- * No allocation, callback or failure here releases reset or frees memory.
+ * Initial construction requires CM3 reset and the context disabled. Runtime
+ * append is allowed only while firmware is blocked awaiting the matching HFI
+ * MEM_ALLOC reply; caller must publish the new backing/tables, invalidate and
+ * synchronize the active context TLB, then reply. Every allocation remains a
+ * boot-lifetime reservation; no failure here releases reset or frees memory.
  */
